# Local email/password auth uses offline screening and opaque D1 sessions.
# Default local origin: http://localhost:1339 (Vite at 1337 is also supported).
# Production requires the public HTTPS origin, without a path or trailing slash:
# AUTH_ORIGIN=https://venue.example.com
# Cloud deployment needs a configured Cloudflare profile, or:
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
AUTH_ORIGIN=http://localhost:1339